        "line": 1447
      }
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "phase": "seal and reveal",
      "behavior": "After camera/box hooks, call seal/sticker hook with its two tape sounds; call title and stars entrance hooks, then play end jingle. Expose result title/stars at these hook points.",
